              "content": "=Here is the description of the job:\n{{ $('Get Data').item.json.descriptionText }}\n\nHere is a summary of the Candidate:\n\nProfessional Profile:\n\nMarketing Specialist with strong focus on digital marketing and marketing automation\nExtensive hands-on experience with major marketing platforms (HubSpot, Meta, LinkedIn, Google)\nProven track record in lead generation and campaign management\nMultilingual: Fluent in English and Bulgarian, currently learning Dutch\nProfessional Experience:\n\nMarketing Specialist at Sciential Digital Marketing (September 2023 - March 2024)\nKey Achievements:\nDelivered 100%+ increase in Webinar registrations\nManaged comprehensive digital marketing campaigns\nExpertise in:\nEmail marketing campaigns\nLead generation strategies\nSocial media management\nHubSpot automation\nGoogle Display and LinkedIn campaign management\nWeb development and landing page creation\nDigital Content Intern at Intersport (February 2023 - September 2023)\nKey Responsibilities:\nDigital content management\nContent portal administration\nAdvanced Excel usage\nPhotoshop content creation\nProject management\nContent optimization\nGym Reception at SportCity (June 2022 - Present)\nDeveloped Skills:\nCustomer service excellence\nSales techniques\nMulti-tasking capabilities\nProblem-solving\nTeam collaboration\nMembership management\nTechnical Skills:\n\nMarketing Platforms: HubSpot, Meta, LinkedIn, Google Ads\nDesign Tools: Photoshop, Canva\nCMS: WordPress\nSEO Tools: SEMrush\nAutomation: Zapier\nAnalytics: Google Analytics\nProject Management Tools\nMicrosoft Excel\nCertifications:\n\nGoogle Analytics\nGoogle Display\nGoogle Search\nHubSpot Marketing Software Certified\nEducation:\n\nBachelor's in International Business & Management with Marketing focus\nHogeschool Rotterdam (RBS) (2019-2024)\nCore Competencies:\n\nDigital Marketing Strategy\nMarketing Automation\nLead Generation\nEmail Marketing\nWeb Development\nAdvertising Campaign Management\nContent Creation\nSocial Media Management\nCustomer Relationship Management\nThis profile would be particularly attractive for:\n\nDigital Marketing Agencies\nIn-house marketing departments\nSaaS companies\nE-commerce businesses\nMarketing technology companies\nYour combination of technical marketing skills, practical experience with major platforms, and proven results (100% increase in webinar registrations) makes you a strong candidate for mid-level digital marketing positions, particularly those focusing on marketing automation, lead generation, and multi-channel campaign management."
